    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow four cuties who pack a punch\u2014Mikoto, Waka, Itsuki, and Yuzuha\u2014as t<strong>hey hack and slash</strong> their way across parallel worlds to rescue Nagi, who has been spirited away by <strong>the villainous Phantom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battling through 8 action-packed stages, they take down the legions of Phantom\u2019s minions standing in their way. The game features <strong>diverse combat mechanics reminiscent of a fighting game</strong>, with strategic action and intense encounters. As players defeat enemies, they level up and earn points to unlock new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up both your characters and skills, rescue Nagi, and return to your world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REVAMPED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay has been rebuilt from scratch in Unreal Engine 5</strong>, giving smoother gameplay, flashier special attacks, and an enhanced online experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLINE CO-OP AND VS MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy local multiplayer with up to 4 players in <strong>co-op or versus modes</strong>. Online multiplayer allows for up to <u><strong>6 players in co-op and up to 8 in versus mode</strong></u>. With <u><strong>cross-platform online play</strong></u>, team up with or face off against players from around the world! <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY AS THE ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of powerful adversaries from the <strong>Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds</strong> universe. A <strong><u>total of 38 characters</u></strong> are playable! Unlock them for co-op and versus modes by completing Story Mode and watching the end-roll. From the biggest baddies to minor grunts, a wide variety awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REMASTERED SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can choose an all-new soundtrack composed by all-girl J-rock band The Phantom Breakers or the classic versions from the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tokyo\u2015the capital of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious man named Phantom plots to regain his sealed powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By giving weaponry known as F.A.s (Fu-mension Artifacts) to the young with special abilities, he lures them into battle with the promise of granting the victor their wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, unbeknownst to the participants, the violent clashes of F.A.s cause distortions in the fabric of space-time, creating rifts between this world and other parallel worlds\u2015</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015rifts that will ultimately compromise the seals binding Phantom's powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waka, daughter of the Kumon Family\u2015an ancient clan that has waged war against evils\u2015along with the support of Mikoto, fights to thwart Phantom's evil plan, but despite their combined might, Phantom manages to escape just in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While fleeing, he kidnaps Waka's younger sister, Nagi Kumon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Itsuki, a maid and self-proclaimed Arbiter of Justice and Yuzuha, a ninja who has resisted Phantom's temptations, join forces with Waka and Mikoto to pursue Phantom and rescue Nagi.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/0e7d35b79dad0947c6fbba6dd7cde13f.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow four cuties who pack a punch\u2014Mikoto, Waka, Itsuki, and Yuzuha\u2014as t<strong>hey hack and slash</strong> their way across parallel worlds to rescue Nagi, who has been spirited away by <strong>the villainous Phantom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battling through 8 action-packed stages, they take down the legions of Phantom\u2019s minions standing in their way. The game features <strong>diverse combat mechanics reminiscent of a fighting game</strong>, with strategic action and intense encounters. As players defeat enemies, they level up and earn points to unlock new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up both your characters and skills, rescue Nagi, and return to your world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REVAMPED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay has been rebuilt from scratch in Unreal Engine 5</strong>, giving smoother gameplay, flashier special attacks, and an enhanced online experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLINE CO-OP AND VS MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy local multiplayer with up to 4 players in <strong>co-op or versus modes</strong>. Online multiplayer allows for up to <u><strong>6 players in co-op and up to 8 in versus mode</strong></u>. With <u><strong>cross-platform online play</strong></u>, team up with or face off against players from around the world! <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY AS THE ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of powerful adversaries from the <strong>Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds</strong> universe. A <strong><u>total of 38 characters</u></strong> are playable! Unlock them for co-op and versus modes by completing Story Mode and watching the end-roll. From the biggest baddies to minor grunts, a wide variety awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/d8135e92eb23a673ecb0ec346308f3e4.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REMASTERED SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can choose an all-new soundtrack composed by all-girl J-rock band The Phantom Breakers or the classic versions from the original games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tokyo\u2015the capital of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious man named Phantom plots to regain his sealed powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By giving weaponry known as F.A.s (Fu-mension Artifacts) to the young with special abilities, he lures them into battle with the promise of granting the victor their wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, unbeknownst to the participants, the violent clashes of F.A.s cause distortions in the fabric of space-time, creating rifts between this world and other parallel worlds\u2015</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015rifts that will ultimately compromise the seals binding Phantom's powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.poster.avif?t=1752020479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.webm?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067350/extras/303eac75f1c985d6e8f4eb88ed556634.mp4?t=1752020479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waka, daughter of the Kumon Family\u2015an ancient clan that has waged war against evils\u2015along with the support of Mikoto, fights to thwart Phantom's evil plan, but despite their combined might, Phantom manages to escape just in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While fleeing, he kidnaps Waka's younger sister, Nagi Kumon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Itsuki, a maid and self-proclaimed Arbiter of Justice and Yuzuha, a ninja who has resisted Phantom's temptations, join forces with Waka and Mikoto to pursue Phantom and rescue Nagi.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds Ultimate&quot; is a side-scrolling beat-'em-up with the heart of a fighting game, showcasing nostalgic pixel art and the latest cross-platform online multiplayer. Experience the biggest and most expansive entry in the &quot;Phantom Breaker: Battle Grounds&quot; series to date!",
